  "note": "Issue 98 adds source-unit-keyed title/body-opening decisions for Volume 8 ordinals 11425-12303 through additive profile v11, preserving every v10 decision unchanged. It advances the honorific formula registry to v1.9.0 with 11 reviewed exact Volume 8 source forms while keeping non-formula Arabic and translation defects outside the registry. Packet-schema document v10 pins registry 1.9.0 to this v12 binding. Packet, shard, tool and stage-provenance data remain version 3.0.0; public-proposal v2, execution registry v2 and sol-xhigh-explicit-host-v1 remain unchanged. Earlier bindings, title profiles, schemas, proposals, releases and evidence retain their original immutable pins."
